Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:10.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.40,0:00:05.12,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,437.715)}Episode 75 \N\N\N\N\NThe Sixth Campaign from Mount Qi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.94,0:00:18.48,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(781.714,173.714)}"Spirit Tablet of \NEmperor of the Great Han, \NLiu Bei."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.46,0:00:34.66,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(314.286,510.857)}Zhūgě Liàng\NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.68,0:00:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As your humble minister embarks on a campaign from Mount Qi once more,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.16,0:01:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I pledge to dedicate my utmost effort
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.72,0:01:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,to eliminating the betrayers of Han,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.12,0:01:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,reclaiming the Central Plains, and restoring the Han Dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.70,0:01:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall devote myself fully to this task, \Nsparing no effort till my last breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.57,0:01:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory is imperative in our upcoming offensive against Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.60,0:01:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All generals must strictly obey military orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.54,0:01:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,fight courageously, and achieve merit for the nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.68,0:01:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.04,0:01:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.84,0:02:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, the Longxiang General of the Left Guard, Guan Xing, has passed away from illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.33,0:02:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan's last words were that he would die with profound regret,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.62,0:02:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,being unable to accompany the Chancellor in battle to reclaim the Central Plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.91,0:02:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A pity...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.55,0:02:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The loyal and righteous are not granted longevity by Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.56,0:02:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We have lost another great warrior for our campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.17,0:02:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wei Yan, Jiang Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.70,0:02:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,At your command!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.94,0:03:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you shall lead the vanguard and advance towards Mount Qi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.17,0:03:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.65,0:03:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Li Feng shall first transport our provisions to the entrance of Xie Valley and standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.95,0:03:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Shu has not invaded for three years,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.24,0:03:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but Zhuge Liang is once again leading an army of three hundred thousand
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.49,0:03:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,to attack from Mount Qi through five separate routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.94,0:03:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How shall we defend against this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.53,0:03:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, Zhuge Liang's recurrent invasions have sapped the strength of his state.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.37,0:03:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The might of Shu is now waning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.76,0:03:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I have recently learned of the death of Guan Yu's son, Guan Xing, due to illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.61,0:03:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shu forces have lost another great general.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.26,0:03:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang is already running out of capable commanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.34,0:03:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,His arrogance compels him to struggle against the will of Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.11,0:03:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,In your minister's opinion, this is nothing more than a path to self-destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.10,0:03:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your majesty, there is no need to be concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.36,0:03:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, how shall we defeat Shu this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.52,0:04:01.68,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(341.333,497.333)}Sīmǎ Yì\NStyled: Zhòngdá
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.53,0:04:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,With your Majesty's blessing, I shall take it upon himself to defeat the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.87,0:04:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I also wish to recommend four individuals to accompany him on this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.69,0:04:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Whom do you recommend, Our liegeman?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.37,0:04:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The four sons of Xiahou Yuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.22,0:04:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They are talented in civil and military affairs with bravery and intellect beyond measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.86,0:04:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They have long sought to avenge their father and can be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.56,0:04:22.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(316,502.667)}Cáo Ruì\NStyled: Yuánzhòng
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.29,0:04:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We approve of your request.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.14,0:04:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We hereby appoint you as Chief-Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.95,0:04:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall mobilize an army of 400,000 soldiers from various locations
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.79,0:04:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and confront the Shu forces at the Wei riverbank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.23,0:04:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,As you command, your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.60,0:04:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Sima Yi's army has arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.35,0:04:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}and constructed a series of nine pontoon bridges across the Wei river.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.87,0:04:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Furthermore, he has instructed Guo Huai and Sun Li to lead the Longxi troops
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.12,0:04:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}in setting up camp on \Nthe north bank of the Wei river.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.81,0:04:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}He fears our forces are cutting off Long Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.19,0:04:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}If we feign an attack at Beiyuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.10,0:04:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}Sima Yi will certainly lead troops to its defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.24,0:05:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Our forces shall then take this chance to cross the Wei river under the cover of night,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.50,0:05:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}burning the pontoon bridges
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.18,0:05:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}while floating downstream on rafts, \Nso as to strike the enemy from the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.05,0:05:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}I will lead a contingent of troops myself to capture their forward camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.17,0:05:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Capturing the southern bank of the Wei river will certainly facilitate our offensive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.25,0:05:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wei Yan, Ma Dai! \N-At your command!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.52,0:05:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you lead five thousand troops to cross the Wei River and feign an attack on Beiyuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.01,0:05:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wu Ban, Wu Yi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.11,0:05:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Present, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.64,0:05:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you shall prepare ample flammable material \Nand lead the raft troops to burn the pontoon bridges.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.44,0:05:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.66,0:05:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wang Ping and Zhang Yi shall be the vanguard,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.87,0:05:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei and Ma Zhong shall be the centre,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and Liao Hua and Zhang Yi will be the rear guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.47,0:05:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our forces shall split up and assault the Wei camp from three routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.86,0:05:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.58,0:05:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals, we must achieve victory in this coming battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.11,0:05:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Only then will our forces be able to press on towards Chang'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.23,0:06:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,General, the Shu troops are attacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.91,0:06:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Issue my order: Retreat! \NRetreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.34,0:06:44.72,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(962.667,500)}Wèi Yán\NStyled: Wéncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.78,0:06:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't right. Retreat immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat! Retreat immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.18,0:07:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wei Yan! Are you not going to dismount and surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.09,0:07:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wei Yan! Zhuge Liang painstakingly crafted this scheme,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.78,0:07:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,instructing you all to feign an attack on my camp,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.77,0:07:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,then secretly sending troops downstream to burn the bridges,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.86,0:07:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,all in the name of concealing the true intention to strike at the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.83,0:07:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This ruse may deceive others, but can it deceive I, Sima?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.50,0:07:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Dismount and surrender now, or else!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.77,0:07:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi has seen through \Nthe Chancellor's plan. What shall we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.98,0:07:29.36,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(294.667,320)}Mǎ Dài
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.68,0:07:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We must fight through!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.88,0:07:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:08:02.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(904,394.667)}Wú Bān
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.01,0:08:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.89,0:08:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.90,0:08:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.30,0:08:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The outcome of the battle ahead is uncertain. \NMy heart is restless
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and I cannot lie or sit still.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.15,0:09:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi has gone to reinforce Beiyuan and his camp is completely undefended!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.58,0:09:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.42,0:09:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.13,0:09:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.02,0:10:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Suffering such humiliating defeat, how irate it makes a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.70,0:10:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.84,0:10:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.89,0:11:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.36,0:11:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.20,0:11:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.47,0:11:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.61,0:11:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.71,0:11:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.25,0:11:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You all must be exhausted. Please rise quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.70,0:11:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and head back to camp to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.26,0:11:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My fellow officers,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.14,0:11:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I am deeply ashamed of my miscalculations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.76,0:12:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The defeat at Wei bridge has cost us more than ten thousand troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.87,0:12:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Failure in the first battle is an ill omen for our sixth campaign from Mount Qi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.05,0:12:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry, Chancellor. Victory and defeat both are part of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.89,0:12:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi is cunning and meticulous, preparing defenses at every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.56,0:12:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeating him will be no easy feat indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.47,0:13:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that relying on our army alone will be insufficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.41,0:13:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, you mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.81,0:13:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I have already prepared a letter for you to present to Sun Quan of Eastern Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.47,0:13:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You must request that he honor our alliance and send troops to open another front.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.39,0:13:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the Wu forces attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.63,0:13:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi will surely be stretched too thin to defend both fronts simultaneously.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.37,0:13:30.64,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In the summer of the third year of Jiāhé era of Eastern Wu (234 AD)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.21,0:13:34.84,Thinking,,0,0,0,,the Chief-Clerk of Shu-Han, Fei Yi, following the orders of Zhuge Liang,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.86,0:13:36.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,delivered the letter to Eastern Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.15,0:13:42.08,Thinking,,0,0,0,,The ruler of Wu, Sun Quan, honoring his alliance with Shu-Han,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.14,0:13:45.98,Thinking,,0,0,0,,commanded his general Lu Xun to lead an army and attack Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.52,0:13:52.28,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Hence, Wei was embroiled in a two-front war with both Shu and Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.26,0:13:57.24,Thinking,,0,0,0,,To redirect his forces to counter the Eastern Wu troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.28,0:14:01.40,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi devised a plan for the Wei general Zheng Wen to feign defection at the Shu camp,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.47,0:14:04.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,intending to create an inside agent for a coordinated attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.64,0:14:09.18,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Yet, Zhuge Liang saw through it and turned the tables on Sima Yi, luring him out of his main camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.40,0:14:12.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,The Wei forces were routed, suffering heavy casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.76,0:14:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My carefully crafted plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,has only led to the deaths of Generals Zheng Wen and Qin Lang,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.56,0:14:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,in addition to the loss of more than ten thousand soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.61,0:14:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Shame on me before the Imperial Court, and shame on me as Commander-in-chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.00,0:14:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, why are you so upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.33,0:14:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We will find another way to defeat the Shu forces in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.14,0:14:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty is personally leading troops against the Wu offensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.21,0:14:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,As a senior official of the Imperial Court, I have failed to relieve his Majesty's burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.48,0:14:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, my failure to defeat the enemy here has plunged the Central Plains into a two-front conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.19,0:14:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How can my heart be at peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:14:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You must remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.59,0:15:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,as a military leader, it is your duty to place the security of the nation above all else.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.50,0:15:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.91,0:15:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi, heed this decree:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.35,0:15:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Eastern Wu forces have invaded on three fronts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.02,0:15:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,His majesty has personally led troops to repel the enemy, already securing an initial victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.29,0:15:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You are to focus all your efforts on defending the Wei river. Do not fret about the Wu forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.77,0:15:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty feared I may be anxious, so has intentionally issued this decree
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.28,0:15:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to reassure me so that I may focus on defending against Zhuge Liang.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.37,0:15:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A wise ruler indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.77,0:15:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, how shall we deal with the enemy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.14,0:15:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang has come from afar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.15,0:15:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The mountain passes are treacherous, making transporting supplies difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.78,0:15:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All we need to do is to hold firm and refuse to engage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:16:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Within a month, the Shu forces will surely run out of supplies and be forced to retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.69,0:16:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass my order, all camps shall hang signs to refuse battle. Gates must be tightly shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.56,0:16:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No one is to engage the enemy. \NAnyone who disobeys will be executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.13,0:16:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.46,0:16:18.52,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,"Refusal to Battle."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.32,0:16:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi has foreseen our supply issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.15,0:17:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He is holding his ground, trying to force us to retreat once we run out of supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.29,0:17:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.79,0:17:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,our grain is stored at Jiange. Transporting it here with manual and animal labour is indeed challenging.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.83,0:17:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If this drags on, we will run out of food and our forces will fall into disarray. You must plan ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.40,0:17:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.73,0:17:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been preparing for this for some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.84,0:17:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.12,0:17:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I present to you my "Wooden Ox and Flowing Horse".
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.51,0:17:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wooden Ox and Flowing Horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.57,0:17:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}Construct them according to these blueprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.99,0:17:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}They will be highly effective at transporting supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.57,0:17:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Not only do these Wooden Oxen need neither food nor water,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.88,0:17:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}they can also work continuously, day and night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}Chancellor, up to this day,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.54,0:17:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}the world has never seen anything akin to this "Wooden Ox"!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.16,0:18:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}Where did you discover them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.29,0:18:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}All inventions in the world stem from human ingenuity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.07,0:18:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}I have long observed many vehicles across various regions
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.43,0:18:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}and studied the locomotion of horses and oxen,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.64,0:18:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}inspiring me for this design.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.75,0:18:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This valley is famously known as Shangfang Valley, also as Calabash Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.71,0:18:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not allow the Wei to discover how to build this device.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.38,0:18:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,These Wooden Oxen might prove useful for other purposes in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No information must be leaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.28,0:18:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.23,0:18:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What is this "Wooden Ox"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.91,0:18:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, the Shu forces seem to have unearthed these fantastical devices from some unknown source.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.68,0:18:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Transporting supplies from Jiange to Mount Qi,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.55,0:18:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,these things need neither food nor water,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.88,0:18:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,traversing rugged mountains as if on flat land.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.16,0:18:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been holding my ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.64,0:18:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,waiting for the Shu troops to run out of supplies and collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.80,0:18:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Using these devices to support their supply lines
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.50,0:19:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,must be part of their long-term strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.24,0:19:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, these Woolen Cows...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.54,0:19:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, {\i1}Wooden{\i0} Ox.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.87,0:19:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly are these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.82,0:19:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Hu, Yue Cheng!\N Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.09,0:19:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you shall lead five hundred men each and intercept from the smaller passes of Xie Gorge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.05,0:19:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for the Shu supply convoy to pass, then ambush their rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.33,0:19:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not bother with their supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you can seize three to five of these "Wooden Oxen",
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.46,0:19:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,that will be a significant accomplishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.72,0:19:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.92,0:19:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.79,0:20:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,, I was caught off guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.36,0:20:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and allowed the Wei forces to steal a handful of Wooden Oxen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.20,0:20:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please mete out punishment, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not be alarmed, General Gao Xiang. \NI have foreseen this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.78,0:20:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I fully intended for Sima Yi to steal some Wooden Oxen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.22,0:20:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Would it not be a waste,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.05,0:20:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,for such ingenious devices to only be used by our army?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.10,0:20:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I lose some Wooden Oxen,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.56,0:20:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall soon reap a greater reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.77,0:20:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.50,0:21:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Exquisite, truly exquisite!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.24,0:21:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, why not try riding it yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.12,0:21:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to ride this cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.81,0:21:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Chief-Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.29,0:21:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Commander, please give it a try. -Very well, I shall!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.06,0:21:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you make this Wooden Ox move?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.36,0:21:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, you just need to tap it on the rear thrice to make it walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.76,0:21:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I shall give it a try then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.20,0:21:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It is walking!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.22,0:21:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Brilliant, brilliant indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If Zhuge Liang can make use of such devices, why can't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.15,0:21:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Order the camp craftsmen to make replicas \Nof this device immediately, the more the better!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.44,0:21:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.50,0:21:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi has made replicas of the stolen Wooden Oxen
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.51,0:21:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and is also using them to transport supplies now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.48,0:22:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi has dispatched the General Who Stabilizes the West, Cen Wei,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.42,0:22:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,with one thousand men to operate the Wooden Oxen
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.86,0:22:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and transport supplies from Longxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.40,0:22:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This is exactly what I hoped for.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.68,0:22:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi only knows of the convenience of the Wooden Oxen
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.94,0:22:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but not its clever secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.66,0:22:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a mechanism hidden in the mouth of the Wooden Oxen:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.88,0:22:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If the tongue is twisted, \Nthe Wooden Oxen will be completely immobilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.40,0:22:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi is in the dark on this, \Nyet still uses them to transport provisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.02,0:22:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He has fallen right into my trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.16,0:22:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, you all shall ambush the Wei camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.30,0:22:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You can follow this plan...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.98,0:23:13.51,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1005.333,229.333)}Líng Wēi
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.64,0:23:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What business brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.94,0:23:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chief-Commander is concerned about the supplies and has sent us to patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.26,0:23:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Move to the side of the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.96,0:23:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood! \NMove to the side!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.10,0:23:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Move to the side!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.38,0:23:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.08,0:23:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?\N You dare try to rob our supplies?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.62,0:23:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wang Ping is here to {\i1}take{\i0} the grain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.72,0:23:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Our main army is right nearby. You are marching to your doom!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.47,0:24:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.92,0:24:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guo, the Shu forces are stealing our supplies!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.36,0:24:11.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(325.333,474.667)}Guō Huái\NStyled: Bójì
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.07,0:24:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Report to the Chief-Commander immediately! \N-Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.55,0:24:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.62,0:24:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.90,0:24:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,, Retreat quickly! The Wei troops are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.91,0:24:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,General, they won't budge!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.96,0:25:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.54,0:25:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat! Retreat immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.98,0:25:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly twist the tongues back!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.63,0:25:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghosts! Sorcery!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.14,0:25:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.58,0:25:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Our provisions are stolen?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.28,0:26:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guo is already leading to their recovery and has sent me to report this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.36,0:26:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Deploy our troops immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.22,0:26:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We must recover the supplies and Wooden Oxen!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.41,0:26:08.85,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.55,0:26:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How are there Shu soldiers here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.36,0:26:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall not escape, Sima Yi!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.48,0:27:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi! Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.31,0:28:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The molten shell of the golden cicada. Not a chance, Sima Yi!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.12,0:28:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Wei army!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.18,0:28:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we've got so much to eat! \NSo much food!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.22,0:28:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, the ambush was successful, all according to your plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.69,0:28:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We pursued Sima Yi, but he unfortunately managed to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.94,0:28:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I do present to you Sima Yi's golden helmet!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.15,0:28:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,General Liao shall receive the top honors for seizing the enemy commander's golden helmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.26,0:28:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.30,0:29:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We have captured over ten thousand {\i1}piculs{\i0} of grain. \NThis is a great victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.43,0:29:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, we shall lure the enemy out into another ambush and annihilate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.04,0:29:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wei! \NAt your service!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.91,0:29:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, you shall hold up Sima Yi's helmet
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.86,0:29:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and taunt the Wei forces in front of their camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.02,0:29:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You must provoke them into attacking so that they may fall into our ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.86,0:29:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, as one of your senior generals, I should be leading charges in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.90,0:29:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This... This business of taunting and insulting in front of the enemy camp,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.40,0:29:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,it is for vulgar women, not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.38,0:29:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This taunting will not be the same as last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.85,0:29:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Sima Yi sees us toying with his Chief-Commander helmet,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.97,0:29:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,he will be unable to bear the humiliation and come out for battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.85,0:29:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you, General Wei Yan, \Nworry about not being able to lead a charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.73,0:30:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Sima Yi can endure mountains of shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.50,0:30:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Can the humiliation of losing his helmet really move him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.27,0:30:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an order. \NAnyone who disobeys will be executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.01,0:30:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi, are you not going to send anyone to retrieve your precious golden helmet?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.73,0:30:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What a laughing stock of a commander you are for losing your precious golden helmet!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.66,0:30:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi, come and retrieve your golden helmet!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.38,0:30:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, your son is willing to engage the enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.11,0:30:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and retrieve the golden helmet. \NFather!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.54,0:31:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not let minor dishonors endanger the greater agenda. Pay no attention to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.64,0:31:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Sima Yi doesn't care for his golden helmet. \NWell, I don't care for it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.46,0:31:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.93,0:31:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.93,0:31:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another pointless round of taunts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.94,0:31:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How frustrating that the Chancellor refuses to listen to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.29,0:32:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi is steadfast in avoiding battle. Our forces need to make preparations for the long term.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.00,0:32:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We can have our soldiers farm alongside the locals.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.90,0:32:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our army shall take one-third of the harvest, and two-thirds shall go to the locals.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.89,0:32:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, the locals can live in peace and prosperity while our army replenishes its supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.88,0:32:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.64,0:32:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Zhuge Liang is ordering his troops to cooperate with the locals,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.81,0:33:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}farming together on the south bank of the Wei River for the long-term.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.66,0:33:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}This will become a grave threat to the state if allowed to continue!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.84,0:33:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Father, why not challenge Zhuge Liang in a pitched battle {\bord13}to settle things once and for all?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.65,0:33:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.39,0:33:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the Emperor's orders to hold my ground. \NI shall not act rashly.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.23,0:33:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You may leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.40,0:33:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.74,0:33:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Though Zhuge Jin has been defeated at Miankou, \NLu Xun is more skilled in military affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.24,0:33:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The outcome of their war against Wei remains difficult to predict.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.79,0:33:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,With Eastern Wu's setbacks, Sima Yi \Nno longer has to worry about the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.52,0:33:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It may become even harder for us to seek a quick and decisive battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.80,0:33:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Could we launch a direct assault on the Wei forces?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.44,0:34:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi is skilled in defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.66,0:34:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,His camp is well-fortified and will be difficult to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.78,0:34:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If this stalemate continues through Autumn and into Winter,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.15,0:34:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the snow will block the mountain passes, making our situation perilous.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.02,0:34:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I share the same concerns.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.66,0:34:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, we must formulate a strategy soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.68,0:34:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief-Commander, your tireless work at the frontlines is beyond value.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.64,0:34:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Please have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.24,0:34:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,These are gifts bestowed by His Majesty, Chief-Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.44,0:34:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I humbly thank His Majesty for His grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.42,0:34:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}His Majesty has led the army to a great victory over the Eastern Wu forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.21,0:34:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}Zhuge Jin has been defeated at Mankou,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.92,0:34:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}and the three armies of Eastern Wu have each been routed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.32,0:35:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}His Majesty has specially ordered me to deliver the good news
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.40,0:35:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}so that the Chief-Commander can focus on defending against Shu with ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.80,0:35:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Indeed! The defeat of Eastern Wu is a testament to His Majesty's great fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.90,0:35:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}Now, I no longer have to worry about our rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.72,0:35:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Please send back word to His Majesty that I will hold the Shu forces at the foot of Mount Qi.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.80,0:35:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.20,0:35:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor? Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.20,0:35:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? \NIt's time to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.78,0:35:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You may go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.41,0:36:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You... \NWhat's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.51,0:36:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, you are already advanced in years, but don't take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.64,0:36:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If you also neglect to eat,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.69,0:36:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,what will become of our army?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.82,0:37:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}Late Emperor, young Heir,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.32,0:37:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}your minister has mounted six campaigns from Mount Qi,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.36,0:37:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}yet have achieved nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.02,0:37:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}In the Late Emperor's temple and the Imperial Court, \Nthey must be awaiting news of my success.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.60,0:37:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}I must bear the duty entrusted to me and mentor his late Majesty's young heir also.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.60,0:37:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}General Guan... \NGeneral Zhang...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.00,0:37:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Please lend me your strength\N from the realm beyond.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.68,0:37:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}Grant me the strength to overcome Sima Yi,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.42,0:38:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}retake the Central Plains, and realize our great cause,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.38,0:38:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}so that your souls may find peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.90,0:38:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Dai! \NAt your service!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.97,0:39:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall lead five thousand troops to Shangfang Valley to prepare an ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.75,0:39:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure to pile dry wood and other flammable materials in the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.54,0:39:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Build some straw huts,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.78,0:39:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,then set up hidden bamboo poles as their fire match.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.04,0:39:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Sima Yi enters the valley, block off the escape routes
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.35,0:39:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and light the flames to annihilate the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.25,0:39:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.89,0:39:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wei Yan! \NAt your service!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.69,0:39:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall lead five thousand troops to challenge the Wei forces at their camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.43,0:39:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You must lure Sima Yi out by feigning defeat, you must not pursue victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.92,0:39:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Should you succeed in luring Sima Yi to Shangfang Valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.07,0:39:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,it shall count as a major achievement.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.74,0:39:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.08,0:39:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Gao Xiang! \NAt your service!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.04,0:39:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Organize clusters of Wooden Oxen numbering twenty to thirty,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.78,0:39:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,or forty to fifty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.98,0:39:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Load them full with grain and loiter through the mountain passes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.47,0:39:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If they can be seized by the Wei, it will be a meritorious feat for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.14,0:39:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.43,0:40:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Liao Hua, Zhang Yi! \NAt your service!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.80,0:40:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you shall lead troops in defending Mount Qi.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.10,0:40:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Wei forces attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.94,0:40:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,you must feign defeat, not seek victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.24,0:40:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If Sima Yi comes in person,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.73,0:40:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,focus all your efforts on attacking south of the Wei river to cut off his escape route.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.00,0:40:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.52,0:40:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals, this battle will be absolutely crucial.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.15,0:40:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi must perish in the flames at Shangfang Valley!

